---
layout: base.njk
title: Officers and committees
---
{% import "macros.njk" as m with context %}
<h1>Officers and committees</h1>
<p>The chapter has three officers, named for the letters of the society. Upsilon leads the chapter and oversees all committees. Pi oversees events and membership. Epsilon oversees finance and publicity.</p>

<h2>Officers</h2>
{{ m.stale(officers.verified) }}
<div class="cards">
  {% for o in officers.officers %}
  <section class="card officer" aria-labelledby="officer-{{ o.greek | lower }}">
    <p class="greek">{{ o.greek }}</p>
    <h3 id="officer-{{ o.greek | lower }}">{{ o.title }}</h3>
    <p class="officer-name">{{ m.tba(o.name) }}</p>
    <p>{{ o.description }}</p>
  </section>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<h2>Committees</h2>
{{ m.stale(committees.verified) }}
<dl class="committees">
  {% for c in committees.committees %}
  <div>
    <dt>{{ c.name }}</dt>
    <dd class="chair">Chair: {{ m.tba(c.chair) }}</dd>
    <dd>{{ c.description }}</dd>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</dl>
